WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.830
Before you start, watch the orange area, not the height.

00:00:04.180 --> 00:00:06.410
The area is the change in momentum.

00:00:07.260 --> 00:00:08.730
Make the stop softer.

00:00:09.100 --> 00:00:12.450
The area stays the same, but the force gets smaller.

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:18.170
Now see if you can get the size of the force below 5 newtons without changing

00:00:18.180 --> 00:00:19.770
the mass or the speed.

